{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大号白字“以后也不变”首先进入视线，紧接着是下方高亮紫色问句“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个正在考虑收起一些心意、减少情感表达的人。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"犹豫、害怕受伤、隐隐的疼痛感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"具体经历了什么、为什么觉得握住的东西留不住，以及幸福中逐渐掺入悲伤的复杂变化，需要看下面较小的正文才能理解。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"白色标题和紫色问句都比较醒目，需要从标题转向问句才能明确这一屏的核心。\",\n    \"具体处境和情绪变化的关系分散在下方较小的正文中，第一眼难以完整获得。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9cd44963-c448-4d13-b681-c7f170154f13", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T021025914534Z", "elapsed_seconds": 33.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:10:59.162939+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "07d00c4ffc7662d3e86ff2ad6d935532cc52af0572f9dad0eba2d5ebc083b6db", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1